  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special- ElevateHER Women&apos;s Technological Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will be used by ImpactHER to minimize the impact of COVID-19 on African women-owned businesses by (i) converting non-technologically enabled businesses to technologically enabled businesses, (ii) connecting female entrepreneurs to capital to help scale their businesses, and (iii) providing world-class entrepreneurship training and business mentorship.</narrative>
  </description>
